  "id": "qualitative-analysis",
  "term": "qualitative analysis",
  "definition": "Qualitative analysis is a way of examining interview-based information in depth so researchers can systematically explore people’s experiences and identify meaningful patterns or categories, such as different coping styles and their effects. In this context, it was used with grounded theory to organize parents’ responses into core themes.",
